  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja4_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.Dialogues.DialoguesData
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - <shake>WATCH OUT! (cof)</shake>\nI sense something horrifying ahead of us. But
    one of my <color=yellow>ingredientes</color=yellow> lies there. Help me get it,
    please!
  - Do not forget to <color=#FF00FF><grow>activate the totem</grow></color>, on the
    right. If a tragedy were to occur, god forbid, it would be of great help for
    you.
  - The other totem sits near the town, I am sure you have seen it. <color=#FF00FF><grow>Until
    this one is activated, the other will remain blocked</grow></color>. Keep that
    in mind while exploring the other areas!
